<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Map red blue afk xp macros 6834-0283-7825 (room button)</Major>
    <Description>This is a macro for afk getting experience on the map 6834-0283-7825 in the room with buttons (to get to which you can know the code).
Go to the map, come to the transition to the room with a timer (who knows, he knows) enter the code, fly on the slide, move to the room with buttons. Go to the left end of the room facing the buttons (the distance from the buttons to the player about half a meter), activate the macro and he himself will start running to the right and left while pressing the buttons with experience. Thus will be given experience passive and for their pressing. All you can go about your business, experience will passively come and the map will not throw out because of inactivity. Enjoy using :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
